1
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:36,080
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:40,080
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:44,080
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:49,080
Bucky D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:52,080
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:55,080
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:58,080
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:58,080 --> 00:03:01,080
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:04,080
Now this is sight!

10
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:08,080
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:11,080
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:16,080
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:23,080
After being separated from his crew,

14
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:26,080
Luffy set out to rescue his captured brother, Ace.

15
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:30,080
To do so, he snuck into the government prison, Impel Down.

16
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:33,080
While Buggy and Mr. Three escaped from level four,

17
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,080
Luffy, who had been poisoned by Warden Magellan,

18
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:39,080
was whisked off to a mysterious haven for prisoners known as New Karma Land.

19
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:43,080
There, he received treatment from its leader, Ivankov.

20
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:47,080
I know what's going on in the world right now.

21
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:50,080
There's been a shift in the tide and big changes are coming.

22
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:53,080
The Navy and the Whitebeard Pirates are taking center stage.

23
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:57,080
Even so, the big man's still waiting things out.

24
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:59,080
I'm of course referring to my comrade,

25
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:02,080
the leader of all revolutionaries in the world.

26
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:05,080
You may know him as Dragon!

27
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:07,080
Oh, you're talking about my dad.

28
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,080
What?

29
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,080
Your dear Papa.

30
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,080
And I never knew.

31
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,080
Godness!

32
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:21,080
After hearing that Luffy is Dragon's son,

33
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:24,080
Ivankov decided to join him in his efforts to rescue Ace.

34
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:27,080
The fever card was pointing down,

35
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:30,080
which means he's still here and still alive, thank goodness.

36
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:34,080
This is it, Quircus D. Ace.

37
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:37,080
You're going to be transferred to Marine Port.

38
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:39,080
Upon your arrival there,

39
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:42,080
